
` CUSTOM ART. see fish_routines_customart.
` a picture in the CustomArt folder whose name ends in _b gets a black line drawn around it by
` FishEffect, one pixel wide, outside the picture. this says which ones did: 1 for those. it is
` by kind of fish, which is the same number as its texture, and the bones have a place of their own.
global CUSTOM_ART_SLOTS = 32
global CUSTOM_ART_BONES_SLOT = 30
global dim CUSTOM_ART_OUTLINE(CUSTOM_ART_SLOTS)
global CUSTOM_ART_COUNT = 0 `how many pictures came from the folder

` THE NEW ART. the fish that have been drawn again, at 32 pixels, are in Fish/Textures/Art32, and
` load_new_art puts them in place of the old 16 pixel ones. FISH_OLD_ART keeps the old ones. the render
` scale of 2 (in fish) is what lets 32 pixels show at the size of 16. NEW_ART is 1 when they are in.
global NEW_ART = 0

` THE LINE AROUND THE NEW ART. the fish have a thick line around them, the color of deep water, that
` FishEffect draws: one pixel of the old 16 pixel art wide, which is the weight of line that the old
` fish have. with the finer drawing of the new art, the old fish's heavier line is what keeps the game
` looking like itself. NEW_ART_THICK is 1 for it. see THE THICK LINE in FishEffect.fx. it was picked from
` a few widths, shapes and colors tried side by side, on 2026-10-18.
global NEW_ART_THICK = 1

` every new picture also comes with a thin black line drawn into it (Name_b), and without one (Name).
` the thick line goes around the picture without one, so this only shows when NEW_ART_THICK is 0.
` NEW_ART_OUTLINE is 1 for the thin line. FISH_ART_OUTLINE=0 starts the game without it.
` in debug mode, the 1 key flips the thin line and the 2 key the thick one. see load_new_art_pictures.
global NEW_ART_OUTLINE = 1
